{
  "_comment": [
    "What a placed feature is, read off what it places. `by_kind` is the Feature it uses and `by_tag` is",
    "the tags of the blocks its configuration names -- see DerivedTags. Vanilla tags no placed feature, so",
    "these two are the whole of it, and they cover each other: a monster room names no block and a",
    "simple_block names nothing but one.",
    "Anything here is overridden per member by art/preset_tags/features.json.",
    "The `c:` rules are the convention tags both loaders share, which is what a modded ore or stone",
    "carries. They match nothing in a world with no mods in it, and that is not a fault -- only",
    "`minecraft:` and ours are insisted on (DerivedTags.weInsistOn)."
  ],
